**Accounting domain:** `fai-object-storage-v1`. Object requests include headers and pooled allocations; reset/reuse avoids a request. Live bytes exclude dead recycling cells, while backing bytes include owned slabs and mappings. Host-language temporaries, allocator arenas and OS rounding are outside these counters. Timing uses separate uninstrumented builds.

